{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":1,"title":"기준보다 큰 값의 개수","desc":"<p>벡터 <code>x</code>에서 <code>threshold</code>보다 <b>큰</b> 값이 몇 개인지 돌려주는 <code>count_greater(x, threshold)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","solution":"count_greater <- function(x, threshold) {\n  sum(x > threshold)\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>x &gt; threshold</code> 는 TRUE/FALSE 벡터가 되고, TRUE는 1로 계산되니 <code>sum()</code>하면 개수예요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"count_greater(c(1, 5, 10), 4)","expected":2,"visible":true},{"call":"count_greater(c(1, 2), 5)","expected":0,"visible":true},{"call":"count_greater(c(5, 5), 5)","expected":0,"visible":false},{"call":"count_greater(numeric(0), 1)","expected":0,"visible":false},{"call":"count_greater(c(-1, 0, 1), -2)","expected":3,"visible":false}],"starter":"count_greater <- function(x, threshold) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-316"}